(2868581, 400538, 57981, '<td valign="top">good shot.<br/> <br/>actually, i gave this shot an 8 when i first saw it, but on review i upped it to 10. partly because i think it''s the only nude, partly because i was angry at having to rate 200 bad shots of flowers. <br/> <br/>the reason i gave an 8 was because of the lighting. the purple light works well, but i found the whiteness across the face too distracting. i also disagreed with the cutting of the bum and hand.<br/> <br/>however i felt i was being too harsh. anyway, this was one of the best shots in the challenge. well done!</td>', 'good shot. actually, i gave this shot an 8 when i first saw it, but on review i upped it to 10. partly because i think it''s the only nude, partly because i was angry at having to rate 200 bad shots of flowers.  the reason i gave an 8 was because of the lighting. the purple light works well, but i found the whiteness across the face too distracting. i also disagreed with the cutting of the bum and hand. however i felt i was being too harsh. anyway, this was one of the best shots in the challenge. well done!', '2006-09-27 09:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
