(2869465, 399229, 42792, '<td valign="top">By itself, this is a compellingly beautiful shot.  Great framing that totally works with the model''s pose and composition.  So very well done and the tones are remarkably alluring.  For this challenge, the hint of purple may be a bit of a stretch.  Great photo all the same and certainly one to be very proud of whatever the outcome.</td>', 'By itself, this is a compellingly beautiful shot.  Great framing that totally works with the model''s pose and composition.  So very well done and the tones are remarkably alluring.  For this challenge, the hint of purple may be a bit of a stretch.  Great photo all the same and certainly one to be very proud of whatever the outcome.', '2006-09-27 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
