(2870299, 402200, 62671, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smile, gorgeous baby!  <br/> <br/><b>Composition/crop </b>= Good<br/><b>Lighting</b> = Great<br/><b>Creativity</b> = Good<br/><b>Focus</b> = Good<br/><b>Subject</b> = cute as heck but needs nose and mouth cleaned up.<br/><b>Color</b> = Love the purple tones but a bit of noise in the shadows.  <br/>I thought it might be the fabric texture but if you look around the chin its a touch noisey there and inside the mouth. <br/>The selvage edge of the fabric is shown. Should have been removed preshoot.<br/>I love the highlight in the eyes.<br/><b>Concept/Story</b> = Great<br/><b>wow factor</b> = Good<br/><b>Marketability</b> = Good (with noise reduction)</td>', 'Beautiful smile, gorgeous baby!   Composition/crop = GoodLighting = GreatCreativity = GoodFocus = GoodSubject = cute as heck but needs nose and mouth cleaned up.Color = Love the purple tones but a bit of noise in the shadows.  I thought it might be the fabric texture but if you look around the chin its a touch noisey there and inside the mouth. The selvage edge of the fabric is shown. Should have been removed preshoot.I love the highlight in the eyes.Concept/Story = Greatwow factor = GoodMarketability = Good (with noise reduction)', '2006-09-27 19:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
