(2870392, 401760, 62671, '<td valign="top"><b>Composition</b> = Exceptional (love the reflection)<br/><b>Lighting</b> = Good (seems a tad dark but adds to the mood)<br/><b>Color</b> = ok (although there are lavendars in this, it feels mostly blue)<br/><b>Creativity</b> = Great<br/><b>Concept/Story</b> = Exceptional<br/><b>Focus/DOF</b> = Great<br/><b>Subject</b> = ok (Does not quite fit the challenge requirements)<br/><b>Wow Factor</b> = Exceptional <br/><b>Marketability</b> = Exceptional<br/><b>Overall</b> = Overall I loved this image. Well thought out and composed.<br/>A little post processing on the color could have been done to meet the challenge but the image doesn''t need it.</td>', 'Composition = Exceptional (love the reflection)Lighting = Good (seems a tad dark but adds to the mood)Color = ok (although there are lavendars in this, it feels mostly blue)Creativity = GreatConcept/Story = ExceptionalFocus/DOF = GreatSubject = ok (Does not quite fit the challenge requirements)Wow Factor = Exceptional Marketability = ExceptionalOverall = Overall I loved this image. Well thought out and composed.A little post processing on the color could have been done to meet the challenge but the image doesn''t need it.', '2006-09-27 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870396, 399537, 58610, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a little off-centered would have improved this a bit. I like the texture you''ve acheived.</td>', 'I wonder if a little off-centered would have improved this a bit. I like the texture you''ve acheived.', '2006-09-27 20:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
