(2870415, 402222, 66182, '<td valign="top">the placement of the subject/s is very good. the eyes follow the zigzag movement as suggested by the picture.</td>', 'the placement of the subject/s is very good. the eyes follow the zigzag movement as suggested by the picture.', '2006-09-27 20:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2870419, 402102, 62671, '<td valign="top"><b>Composition/Crop</b> = Great<br/><b>Lighting</b> = Great<br/><b>Color</b> = Good (I am guessing the flower color is bleeding thru because his wings are flapping so fast, makes it interesting)<br/><b>Creativity</b> = Good <br/><b>Concept/Story</b> = Great  (I had not seen one of these before)<br/><b>Focus/DOF</b> = Great (I like how you have movement on the wings and yet such clarity.  I''m not sure I could pull that off yet, myself)<br/><b>Subject</b> = ok (The subject is not purple, though he appears to be here. Its a little confusing since this isn''t his true colors.)<br/><b>Wow Factor</b> = Good<br/><b>Marketability</b> = Good (Not being the true color would effect this factor)<br/> <br/><b>Overall</b> I found this image interesting since I haven''t seen this moth before.  He has great markings.</td>', 'Composition/Crop = GreatLighting = GreatColor = Good (I am guessing the flower color is bleeding thru because his wings are flapping so fast, makes it interesting)Creativity = Good Concept/Story = Great  (I had not seen one of these before)Focus/DOF = Great (I like how you have movement on the wings and yet such clarity.  I''m not sure I could pull that off yet, myself)Subject = ok (The subject is not purple, though he appears to be here. Its a little confusing since this isn''t his true colors.)Wow Factor = GoodMarketability = Good (Not being the true color would effect this factor) Overall I found this image interesting since I haven''t seen this moth before.  He has great markings.', '2006-09-27 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
