(2870449, 399876, 62671, '<td valign="top"><b>Composition/Crop</b> = Great (horizon is in the center but works here.  the main rock silhouette is set on the right 1/3rd very well.  Bird could have been in a better location. darn him! <br/><b>Lighting</b> = Exceptional (love the fact the sun is completely behind the main rock formation) <br/><b>Color</b> = Exceptional (The gradient is spectacular)<br/><b>Creativity</b> = Great (I have not seen many similar scenery images)<br/><b>Concept/Story</b> = Great <br/><b>Focus/DOF</b> = Great<br/><b>Subject</b> = Great (Meets challenge requirements)<br/><b>Wow Factor</b> = Exceptional<br/><b>Marketability</b> = Exceptional<br/> <br/><b>Overall</b> I love everything about this image. Especially the ''ghostly'' apearance of the furthest rock formation.  I don''t think this image would have worked without it.</td>', 'Composition/Crop = Great (horizon is in the center but works here.  the main rock silhouette is set on the right 1/3rd very well.  Bird could have been in a better location. darn him! Lighting = Exceptional (love the fact the sun is completely behind the main rock formation) Color = Exceptional (The gradient is spectacular)Creativity = Great (I have not seen many similar scenery images)Concept/Story = Great Focus/DOF = GreatSubject = Great (Meets challenge requirements)Wow Factor = ExceptionalMarketability = Exceptional Overall I love everything about this image. Especially the ''ghostly'' apearance of the furthest rock formation.  I don''t think this image would have worked without it.', '2006-09-27 21:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
