(2872898, 399876, 53147, '<td valign="top">Back to comment. Coming across this the first time around I said to myself "There is the winner". Didnt even have to look at all of the entries (though I did). I dont think I could list all of the things that are excellent about this pic and I dont think I could find one thing wrong with it. This should be a print. Hope you are watching your score cause you are about to see a serious bump. Started you with my obligatory 7 as an image marker for my return view. Good luck inthe challenge (though I dont think you will need it).</td>', 'Back to comment. Coming across this the first time around I said to myself "There is the winner". Didnt even have to look at all of the entries (though I did). I dont think I could list all of the things that are excellent about this pic and I dont think I could find one thing wrong with it. This should be a print. Hope you are watching your score cause you are about to see a serious bump. Started you with my obligatory 7 as an image marker for my return view. Good luck inthe challenge (though I dont think you will need it).', '2006-09-28 14:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2872899, 401762, 24454, '<td valign="top">Way to GO, bringing out those <i>killer</i> eyes without making them look fake!</td>', 'Way to GO, bringing out those killer eyes without making them look fake!', '2006-09-28 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2872916, 400705, 24454, '<td valign="top">I find this such a cool photo.   I always really admire photographers who are able to make art out of the ordinary!  Excellent color, focus, and perfect composition.   I hope you aren''t hearing the typical robot comment that people almost always get when they have a centered subject because this photo is very much enhanced by the subject being centered in my opinion.  Some people just think "guidelines" are rigid rules that forbid people from being creative.   This is awesome!  10</td>', 'I find this such a cool photo.   I always really admire photographers who are able to make art out of the ordinary!  Excellent color, focus, and perfect composition.   I hope you aren''t hearing the typical robot comment that people almost always get when they have a centered subject because this photo is very much enhanced by the subject being centered in my opinion.  Some people just think "guidelines" are rigid rules that forbid people from being creative.   This is awesome!  10', '2006-09-28 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2872917, 401239, 53278, '<td valign="top">i love this shot!you should get the blue ribbon, 10</td>', 'i love this shot!you should get the blue ribbon, 10', '2006-09-28 14:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
