(2875003, 401859, 61191, '<td valign="top">I love your idea and composition but there are two things I don''t like: the flowers are out of focus. They are essential elements so they must be sharp imho. The green spot in the upper left corner works distracting. Without those issues your shot should have done way better. Anyway: great idea and composition!</td>', 'I love your idea and composition but there are two things I don''t like: the flowers are out of focus. They are essential elements so they must be sharp imho. The green spot in the upper left corner works distracting. Without those issues your shot should have done way better. Anyway: great idea and composition!', '2006-09-29 07:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875005, 399876, 27275, '<td valign="top">Photoshop purple...</td>', 'Photoshop purple...', '2006-09-29 07:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875006, 402126, 61191, '<td valign="top">Your idea is nice. Unfortunately your subject is a bit out of focus. And why do you use such a small size for your shot? I think DPClers always prefer larger shots. If you have problems resizing your shot have a look at  <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link</a>.</td>', 'Your idea is nice. Unfortunately your subject is a bit out of focus. And why do you use such a small size for your shot? I think DPClers always prefer larger shots. If you have problems resizing your shot have a look at  link.', '2006-09-29 07:08:12.000000', NULL, 1);
