(2875341, 400928, 48890, '<td valign="top">A nice choice of objects colour-wise.  A few problems: (1) compositionally, negative space on the right is not working to the advantage, there is a feeling of disbalance in the composition, (2) lighting is a bit too harsh, destroying the textures on the garlic and the eggplant, and (3) your room is reflected in the jar, need to be careful about that. 6</td>', 'A nice choice of objects colour-wise.  A few problems: (1) compositionally, negative space on the right is not working to the advantage, there is a feeling of disbalance in the composition, (2) lighting is a bit too harsh, destroying the textures on the garlic and the eggplant, and (3) your room is reflected in the jar, need to be careful about that. 6', '2006-09-29 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875345, 402186, 48890, '<td valign="top">4</td>', '4', '2006-09-29 11:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
