(2875359, 401275, 57936, '<td valign="top">The DOF is a bit funky. The ultra sharp tip and blurry background is ok, but it seems like the less interesting part of the flower is sharp here. Also, there is a leaf at the bottom center that catches the eye and distracts. I would have cropped it out for this chllenge (Though cloning would be better as to not lose more petal, but not for a basic editing challenge!)</td>', 'The DOF is a bit funky. The ultra sharp tip and blurry background is ok, but it seems like the less interesting part of the flower is sharp here. Also, there is a leaf at the bottom center that catches the eye and distracts. I would have cropped it out for this chllenge (Though cloning would be better as to not lose more petal, but not for a basic editing challenge!)', '2006-09-29 11:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
