(2875702, 400733, 64446, '<td valign="top">Good contrast with an unsual tone in the background. It would be great to have the vertical thread focused too.</td>', 'Good contrast with an unsual tone in the background. It would be great to have the vertical thread focused too.', '2006-09-29 13:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875703, 402147, 27524, '<td valign="top">It might go the same good/bad as other flowers in this challenge but you defenetly missed the focus...maybe its more on green part but not on purple. Keep shoting!</td>', 'It might go the same good/bad as other flowers in this challenge but you defenetly missed the focus...maybe its more on green part but not on purple. Keep shoting!', '2006-09-29 13:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875705, 399460, 64446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful daisy.</td>', 'Beautiful daisy.', '2006-09-29 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875706, 399003, 60868, '<td valign="top">the sun light is too strong</td>', 'the sun light is too strong', '2006-09-29 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875707, 402270, 27524, '<td valign="top">Yes its purple but i dont find the blurred guy so interesting. If you ment it as sillueth photo then could try get more focus on it. It could be problem because of lack of light.</td>', 'Yes its purple but i dont find the blurred guy so interesting. If you ment it as sillueth photo then could try get more focus on it. It could be problem because of lack of light.', '2006-09-29 13:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875710, 400971, 64446, '<td valign="top">A closer crop would have worked better...</td>', 'A closer crop would have worked better...', '2006-09-29 13:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875712, 401508, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its not bad at all...I like that background with curves. Oh just noticed that stone there! Ups. Well that means you really tried to be creative. One thing that defenetly will take you down is focus. Maybe its there but maybe not enough. Keep shoting!</td>', 'Its not bad at all...I like that background with curves. Oh just noticed that stone there! Ups. Well that means you really tried to be creative. One thing that defenetly will take you down is focus. Maybe its there but maybe not enough. Keep shoting!', '2006-09-29 13:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875714, 401409, 27524, '<td valign="top">Your chosen object are interesting but I would suggest to experiment more with your composition. Also the focus might be problem here.</td>', 'Your chosen object are interesting but I would suggest to experiment more with your composition. Also the focus might be problem here.', '2006-09-29 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875721, 401256, 64446, '<td valign="top">She is cutie, he not so... Should have cropped half of his face away...<br/>What it the focus was on her instead of him?</td>', 'She is cutie, he not so... Should have cropped half of his face away...What it the focus was on her instead of him?', '2006-09-29 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875729, 401717, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, but the flower is too damaged.</td>', 'Nice focus, but the flower is too damaged.', '2006-09-29 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875732, 401870, 27524, '<td valign="top">Honestly its not appealing. Maybe you like it just because its your baby but for stanger...hmm. For picture taking I suggest to use plain colors as bacground etc. nothing stripy or dotty. Also seems you went too much in close up and missed the focus. Every camera have different minimal focus range, you should check your or use macro mode.</td>', 'Honestly its not appealing. Maybe you like it just because its your baby but for stanger...hmm. For picture taking I suggest to use plain colors as bacground etc. nothing stripy or dotty. Also seems you went too much in close up and missed the focus. Every camera have different minimal focus range, you should check your or use macro mode.', '2006-09-29 13:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875737, 402216, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its nice strong colors but photo is to small to see the detail. Should always try to present as big photo as possible. Alos its not clear enough if you have focus there or not.</td>', 'Its nice strong colors but photo is to small to see the detail. Should always try to present as big photo as possible. Alos its not clear enough if you have focus there or not.', '2006-09-29 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875741, 401635, 27524, '<td valign="top">This is the case when half desaturation doesnt seem to work so good. Maybe should have pulled it till grey if it was disturbant but somewhere between. The focus also seems bit too soft.</td>', 'This is the case when half desaturation doesnt seem to work so good. Maybe should have pulled it till grey if it was disturbant but somewhere between. The focus also seems bit too soft.', '2006-09-29 13:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875747, 400113, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its creative and interesting but bit strange also. I wouldnt say I like the black border you used. Maybe could croped it out.</td>', 'Its creative and interesting but bit strange also. I wouldnt say I like the black border you used. Maybe could croped it out.', '2006-09-29 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875748, 400469, 64446, '<td valign="top">Not very exciting subject.</td>', 'Not very exciting subject.', '2006-09-29 13:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875754, 398693, 64446, '<td valign="top">Less centred would have more impact.</td>', 'Less centred would have more impact.', '2006-09-29 14:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875757, 399878, 64446, '<td valign="top">why border?</td>', 'why border?', '2006-09-29 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875759, 401893, 64446, '<td valign="top">to much border</td>', 'to much border', '2006-09-29 14:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875763, 400113, 64446, '<td valign="top">It seems off focus to me.</td>', 'It seems off focus to me.', '2006-09-29 14:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875767, 402198, 64446, '<td valign="top">nice idea. bg too white. she looks more funny than angry.</td>', 'nice idea. bg too white. she looks more funny than angry.', '2006-09-29 14:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875775, 400952, 55908, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! I always love the photographs that leave me thinking, "How''s he/she do that?" Nice fresh take on the challenge and well captured. 8o)</td>', 'This is beautiful! I always love the photographs that leave me thinking, "How''s he/she do that?" Nice fresh take on the challenge and well captured. 8o)', '2006-09-29 14:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875777, 402223, 55908, '<td valign="top">That''s great! The expression gives this photo such a fun dynamic and the lighting is quite interesting too. Great imagination! 8o)</td>', 'That''s great! The expression gives this photo such a fun dynamic and the lighting is quite interesting too. Great imagination! 8o)', '2006-09-29 14:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875874, 400796, 35720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me. I like the shot nevertheless. Good job! (6)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me. I like the shot nevertheless. Good job! (6)', '2006-09-29 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875876, 401856, 35720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me. Great shot though.(6)</td>', 'Beautiful, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me. Great shot though.(6)', '2006-09-29 14:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875880, 399605, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me (as says in the title). Excellent work though.(6)</td>', 'Great shot, but the colour looks more like violet than purple to me (as says in the title). Excellent work though.(6)', '2006-09-29 14:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875896, 401246, 19672, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot....I think I''d like it better without the white border.  Gave you an 8, the border probably keeps it from being a 9.<br/> <br/>Nicely layed out though...</td>', 'Very interesting shot....I think I''d like it better without the white border.  Gave you an 8, the border probably keeps it from being a 9. Nicely layed out though...', '2006-09-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875903, 402089, 32378, '<td valign="top">Dang! I must have missed this rally.</td>', 'Dang! I must have missed this rally.', '2006-09-29 15:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875908, 400960, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great detail, I can feel the texture in this image! Makes me want some grapes! 8o)</td>', 'Great detail, I can feel the texture in this image! Makes me want some grapes! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875911, 400647, 55908, '<td valign="top">Lovely image! The jet streams really add a nice dynamic to the way the photo is read and really bring the focus to the tree and the purple. Well done. 8o)</td>', 'Lovely image! The jet streams really add a nice dynamic to the way the photo is read and really bring the focus to the tree and the purple. Well done. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875912, 401733, 55908, '<td valign="top">Images like these always catch my attention! Nice take on the challenge and well captured. 8o)</td>', 'Images like these always catch my attention! Nice take on the challenge and well captured. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875915, 400750, 19672, '<td valign="top">Hey...it''s purple... :)</td>', 'Hey...it''s purple... :)', '2006-09-29 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875916, 399952, 19672, '<td valign="top">Cabbage!!!!!<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>I like cabbage...</td>', 'Cabbage!!!!! :) I like cabbage...', '2006-09-29 15:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875917, 400660, 19672, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot...</td>', 'Excellent shot...', '2006-09-29 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875920, 401707, 55908, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully unique image! Very well composed and well done building a pyramid out of spheres! A simple and refreshshing idea worked quite well for this challenge and you''ve captured it well! 8o)</td>', 'Wonderfully unique image! Very well composed and well done building a pyramid out of spheres! A simple and refreshshing idea worked quite well for this challenge and you''ve captured it well! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875923, 401669, 19672, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. You''ve made her legs almost a shadow by how you''ve lit it...<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Interesting composition. You''ve made her legs almost a shadow by how you''ve lit it... :)', '2006-09-29 15:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875928, 402036, 55908, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and well captured image! Technically it seems near perfect and the timing for the drop is great as well. 8o)</td>', 'Beautiful and well captured image! Technically it seems near perfect and the timing for the drop is great as well. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875932, 402250, 60370, '<td valign="top">The specks on the surface are kind of distracting.  I like the composition and contrasting shapes.  Focus and reflection are great. 7</td>', 'The specks on the surface are kind of distracting.  I like the composition and contrasting shapes.  Focus and reflection are great. 7', '2006-09-29 15:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875937, 401992, 55908, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, feels like it''s lacking a bit of sharpness though. But it''s nice to see something other than a purple flower every once in a whileno offence to those who made photos of purple flowers, of course. 8o)</td>', 'Nice idea, feels like it''s lacking a bit of sharpness though. But it''s nice to see something other than a purple flower every once in a whileno offence to those who made photos of purple flowers, of course. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875938, 401246, 60370, '<td valign="top">I love this one.  I''m glad you didn''t crop out the edges of the fabric. Excellent composition.  Well done! 10<br/> <br/>Edited fierce typo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-04 19:37:33.</i></td>', 'I love this one.  I''m glad you didn''t crop out the edges of the fabric. Excellent composition.  Well done! 10 Edited fierce typo.', '2006-09-29 15:13:58.000000', '2006-10-04 20:37:33.000000', 1),
(2875943, 402243, 55908, '<td valign="top">My first thought, VIBRANT! Love that! My second thought, a different twist on photographing a purple flowerI like that too! Very interesting photo and nicely captured. Might benefit from a bit more depth, particularly to keep the edges of the petals nice and sharp, but that''s just my preference. 8o)</td>', 'My first thought, VIBRANT! Love that! My second thought, a different twist on photographing a purple flowerI like that too! Very interesting photo and nicely captured. Might benefit from a bit more depth, particularly to keep the edges of the petals nice and sharp, but that''s just my preference. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875944, 402235, 60370, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors but, it seems a little hazy or washed out.  If the colors were more saturated it may hold my interest a little longer.  Nice job and idea though.</td>', 'Pretty colors but, it seems a little hazy or washed out.  If the colors were more saturated it may hold my interest a little longer.  Nice job and idea though.', '2006-09-29 15:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875947, 402270, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great angle for the challenge! I wish it were sharper but know it can be difficult with limited light. Beside that, I like the image''s composition and mood. 8o)</td>', 'Great angle for the challenge! I wish it were sharper but know it can be difficult with limited light. Beside that, I like the image''s composition and mood. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875954, 402200, 62813, '<td valign="top">cute :)</td>', 'cute :)', '2006-09-29 15:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875956, 400593, 55908, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''ve ever seen a horse trailer like that! I want it though! For me, composition leaves a little to be desired, but I really like that you''ve used an atypical and unprdictable subject for the challenge! 8o)</td>', 'I don''t think I''ve ever seen a horse trailer like that! I want it though! For me, composition leaves a little to be desired, but I really like that you''ve used an atypical and unprdictable subject for the challenge! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875957, 400836, 62813, '<td valign="top">beautiful...</td>', 'beautiful...', '2006-09-29 15:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875963, 401994, 60370, '<td valign="top">She seems a little too "unsharp masked".  Great color but not sure about the crop.  With such a tight crop I would have gotten rid of the wood floor above her head and perhaps lost the ear and added more purple to the top.  Nice job and I''m jealous of her skin :)  No neat image needed here!  7</td>', 'She seems a little too "unsharp masked".  Great color but not sure about the crop.  With such a tight crop I would have gotten rid of the wood floor above her head and perhaps lost the ear and added more purple to the top.  Nice job and I''m jealous of her skin :)  No neat image needed here!  7', '2006-09-29 15:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875967, 399876, 62813, '<td valign="top">wooooo...awasome!!!</td>', 'wooooo...awasome!!!', '2006-09-29 15:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875970, 401669, 60370, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too dark and not very interesting.  The light shining is in a precarious spot :)  Somebody in there? 5</td>', 'Seems a little too dark and not very interesting.  The light shining is in a precarious spot :)  Somebody in there? 5', '2006-09-29 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2875971, 401994, 55908, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! It could even use a bit more purple andnot to be overly pickya bit less wood in the upper left corner. I was also thinking maybe purple lip stick and eyeshadow really would have put this image above and beyond. Just a though. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Nice idea! It could even use a bit more purple andnot to be overly pickya bit less wood in the upper left corner. I was also thinking maybe purple lip stick and eyeshadow really would have put this image above and beyond. Just a though. Well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875975, 401798, 55908, '<td valign="top">The sheen on the thread really brings this photo to life! I think the cropping works well too. Well done. 8o)</td>', 'The sheen on the thread really brings this photo to life! I think the cropping works well too. Well done. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875982, 400931, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo! I hope there aren''t too many comments picking on the "straightness" of the image, I actually like how it leans! My only critical thought is that the highlights in the back may be a bit too intense and rob detail. But overall it''s a nice image. 8o)</td>', 'Very interesting photo! I hope there aren''t too many comments picking on the "straightness" of the image, I actually like how it leans! My only critical thought is that the highlights in the back may be a bit too intense and rob detail. But overall it''s a nice image. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875985, 401239, 55908, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait and wonderful use of selective saturation! Seems very well crafted and thought out. 8o)</td>', 'Lovely portrait and wonderful use of selective saturation! Seems very well crafted and thought out. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875992, 401047, 55908, '<td valign="top">Very cute! The fanned out dress really brings it together. Her gaze leaves me wondering, which is a good thing. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Very cute! The fanned out dress really brings it together. Her gaze leaves me wondering, which is a good thing. Well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875995, 401874, 19672, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of the purple. I feel the glass itself has too many artifacts and distractions. (5)</td>', 'I like the capture of the purple. I feel the glass itself has too many artifacts and distractions. (5)', '2006-09-29 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875996, 401875, 19672, '<td valign="top">hot pink?</td>', 'hot pink?', '2006-09-29 15:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875997, 400606, 55908, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot! The shallow dof works nicely. Overall the image is clean and seems like it could be an important piece of a bigger story. Excellent job on a well crafted photo! 8o)</td>', 'Interesting shot! The shallow dof works nicely. Overall the image is clean and seems like it could be an important piece of a bigger story. Excellent job on a well crafted photo! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2875998, 402210, 19672, '<td valign="top">wow...excellent capture of detail for an aquarium shot....<br/> <br/>(or was this post-processed from the background?)</td>', 'wow...excellent capture of detail for an aquarium shot.... (or was this post-processed from the background?)', '2006-09-29 15:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876000, 399952, 55908, '<td valign="top">The marbling is wonderful! Might benefit from a bit more luminance to really make the colors spark, but that''s one guys opinion. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'The marbling is wonderful! Might benefit from a bit more luminance to really make the colors spark, but that''s one guys opinion. Well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876004, 402186, 19672, '<td valign="top">This was a tough call between 6 and 7.  I liked the shirt, the pose, the background.  Two elements are iffy with me.<br/> <br/>I would have liked to see a bit more clearance above the head. (There is plenty of room in front of the feet.)<br/> <br/>And that blasted white sock...what is up with that?</td>', 'This was a tough call between 6 and 7.  I liked the shirt, the pose, the background.  Two elements are iffy with me. I would have liked to see a bit more clearance above the head. (There is plenty of room in front of the feet.) And that blasted white sock...what is up with that?', '2006-09-29 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876009, 402253, 19672, '<td valign="top">This is just a great shot and lots of fun....</td>', 'This is just a great shot and lots of fun....', '2006-09-29 15:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876010, 402033, 55908, '<td valign="top">Lovely mood set. I know post processing is a very subjective thing, but maybe a bit more contrast would really make this image pop! Great shot though! 8o)</td>', 'Lovely mood set. I know post processing is a very subjective thing, but maybe a bit more contrast would really make this image pop! Great shot though! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876018, 402221, 19672, '<td valign="top">Nice pose...but why not purple lipstick?<br/> <br/>Also...too much blank space to the left.</td>', 'Nice pose...but why not purple lipstick? Also...too much blank space to the left.', '2006-09-29 15:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876020, 399030, 55908, '<td valign="top">The orange lights and reflections against the purple sky and water are a nice spark and compliment the sunset well! The only thing that breaks the mood for me is the surfer in the lower left. Not a big deal though. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'The orange lights and reflections against the purple sky and water are a nice spark and compliment the sunset well! The only thing that breaks the mood for me is the surfer in the lower left. Not a big deal though. Well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876022, 401823, 19672, '<td valign="top">odd but intriguing...<br/> <br/>good sharpness and color...<br/> <br/>but what IS it?</td>', 'odd but intriguing... good sharpness and color... but what IS it?', '2006-09-29 15:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876029, 401856, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge! The exposure is great and really highlights exactly where you want the focus. Well done! 8o)</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge! The exposure is great and really highlights exactly where you want the focus. Well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876032, 401808, 19672, '<td valign="top">interesting camera angle</td>', 'interesting camera angle', '2006-09-29 15:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876034, 402137, 19672, '<td valign="top">hot pink?</td>', 'hot pink?', '2006-09-29 15:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876043, 400502, 55908, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge! I alway like how many skin-tones compliment purple so well. Maybe a tad bit more depth to keep the right side of the body in focus, but overall, very well done! 8o)</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge! I alway like how many skin-tones compliment purple so well. Maybe a tad bit more depth to keep the right side of the body in focus, but overall, very well done! 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876045, 401281, 57429, '<td valign="top">Really nice texture</td>', 'Really nice texture', '2006-09-29 15:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876049, 400114, 19672, '<td valign="top">nice geometric...would like a bit more DOF or sharpness on this...</td>', 'nice geometric...would like a bit more DOF or sharpness on this...', '2006-09-29 15:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876054, 402041, 19672, '<td valign="top">Superb....<br/> <br/>BTW...have you seen Neil Gaimon''s "Mirror Mask"</td>', 'Superb.... BTW...have you seen Neil Gaimon''s "Mirror Mask"', '2006-09-29 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876055, 401820, 57429, '<td valign="top">Love the texture and the composition and the DOF</td>', 'Love the texture and the composition and the DOF', '2006-09-29 15:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876057, 402122, 19672, '<td valign="top">Sadly, it looks like the focus is not on your main subject....otherwise, I''d have rated a bit more highly.</td>', 'Sadly, it looks like the focus is not on your main subject....otherwise, I''d have rated a bit more highly.', '2006-09-29 15:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876058, 400592, 57429, '<td valign="top">Wow...eye popping purple</td>', 'Wow...eye popping purple', '2006-09-29 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876061, 401293, 57429, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle coloring</td>', 'Nice subtle coloring', '2006-09-29 15:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876064, 402260, 19672, '<td valign="top">Too square....this is a shot that could benefit from a bit more black space on either the left or right...or bottom.</td>', 'Too square....this is a shot that could benefit from a bit more black space on either the left or right...or bottom.', '2006-09-29 15:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876066, 402198, 57429, '<td valign="top">Fun picture..and purple</td>', 'Fun picture..and purple', '2006-09-29 15:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2876068, 401997, 55908, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve been made well aware of the date in the bottom right. Wouldn''t be so bad if it weren''t orange. But putting that aside, I think your overall intention was in the right place with the main focus is on the flowers. But the petal in the center of the photograph fell out of focus there which normally would slip by, but since it''s in the center, it becomes kind of distracting. <br/> <br/>Overall, the image seems a little over-compressed or over-sharpened. On the upside, the colors pop really well against the green background, so well done on that! But I''d say pay close attention to choosing a definite focal point and making sure that everything you want focused is where you want it. 8o)</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve been made well aware of the date in the bottom right. Wouldn''t be so bad if it weren''t orange. But putting that aside, I think your overall intention was in the right place with the main focus is on the flowers. But the petal in the center of the photograph fell out of focus there which normally would slip by, but since it''s in the center, it becomes kind of distracting.  Overall, the image seems a little over-compressed or over-sharpened. On the upside, the colors pop really well against the green background, so well done on that! But I''d say pay close attention to choosing a definite focal point and making sure that everything you want focused is where you want it. 8o)', '2006-09-29 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
