(2876532, 401893, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice tones.  feels a bit soft, which wouldn''t have been bad but those water dropplets to me, require a super shart reflecetion.  would have liked to see a better composition with the water droplets more evenly place around all parts of the flower...i lied i wish you didn''t succumb to the need for water droplets  at all ;)</td>', 'nice tones.  feels a bit soft, which wouldn''t have been bad but those water dropplets to me, require a super shart reflecetion.  would have liked to see a better composition with the water droplets more evenly place around all parts of the flower...i lied i wish you didn''t succumb to the need for water droplets  at all ;)', '2006-09-29 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
