(2879077, 402233, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice crisp image.  Though, I think your spider''s drunk, as that''s the crappiest looking web I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'nice crisp image.  Though, I think your spider''s drunk, as that''s the crappiest looking web I''ve ever seen.', '2006-09-30 23:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
