(2879100, 400323, 13688, '<td valign="top">this leaves me very curious as to his surroundings.  dpc likes to see the details though, and not the big picture, so your choice was probably very sound.  your shadow boost feels a bit excessive.  nice job of separating him from the background.  It still looks a bit sketchy though around his hands and face, as if it was spot blurred, but i know you couldn''t have done that ;)</td>', 'this leaves me very curious as to his surroundings.  dpc likes to see the details though, and not the big picture, so your choice was probably very sound.  your shadow boost feels a bit excessive.  nice job of separating him from the background.  It still looks a bit sketchy though around his hands and face, as if it was spot blurred, but i know you couldn''t have done that ;)', '2006-10-01 00:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2879104, 399886, 13688, '<td valign="top">branch patterns are interesting</td>', 'branch patterns are interesting', '2006-10-01 00:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2879115, 399214, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting you chose to keep that stuff in the foreground.  Truthfully, i''m not even sure what it is.  perhaps it''s nearer to your heart.  but it really ruins the scene for me.</td>', 'interesting you chose to keep that stuff in the foreground.  Truthfully, i''m not even sure what it is.  perhaps it''s nearer to your heart.  but it really ruins the scene for me.', '2006-10-01 00:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
