(2887306, 402099, 50695, '<td valign="top">it''s good that you made the center gear off-center, but I don''t think you went far enough. It is still completely within frame, and we can see other gears surrounding it on every side. There is a slight gradation of light from right to left and some highlights on the tips of the gears, but it is subtle and regular, while the background is completely black. The overall result is a static picture without much energy.</td>', 'it''s good that you made the center gear off-center, but I don''t think you went far enough. It is still completely within frame, and we can see other gears surrounding it on every side. There is a slight gradation of light from right to left and some highlights on the tips of the gears, but it is subtle and regular, while the background is completely black. The overall result is a static picture without much energy.', '2006-10-02 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
