(2888577, 400612, 50695, '<td valign="top">my left brain said "this is just another macro shot" but then my right brain wouldn''t let me look away from it. I was immediately grabbed with emotion. That bee... is weeping... ridiculous, I know, but I could not shake the idea. and the sad, shattered petals of that flower, which provides him no comfort. The picture is heartbreaking. How did you do that? I know how! Magic.</td>', 'my left brain said "this is just another macro shot" but then my right brain wouldn''t let me look away from it. I was immediately grabbed with emotion. That bee... is weeping... ridiculous, I know, but I could not shake the idea. and the sad, shattered petals of that flower, which provides him no comfort. The picture is heartbreaking. How did you do that? I know how! Magic.', '2006-10-02 19:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888580, 402223, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate when I get a runny nose onstage! It''s so embarrassing. ;) I like the lighting, it enhances the effect of the outfit.</td>', 'I hate when I get a runny nose onstage! It''s so embarrassing. ;) I like the lighting, it enhances the effect of the outfit.', '2006-10-02 19:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888600, 399666, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hate selective desaturation. I hate portraits when the model is forced to do something unnatural just for the picture. So, why do I LOVE this photograph?? <br/> <br/>my latest theory: the purple does not accentuate a single thing or even a group of things, it infuses the entire photograph, creating an ethereal effect, and for some reason combines well with gray (a different color and the child would have looked sickly). Then there''s the toughness of the child''s face, combined with the fact that she is presenting us her feet. Instead of the usual vulnerability expected of the photo''s subject, she is well protected, well defended. The flower-in-the-mouth cliche is all about vulnerability. The flower-in-the-feet is all about invulnerability. This shot is a 10.</td>', 'I hate selective desaturation. I hate portraits when the model is forced to do something unnatural just for the picture. So, why do I LOVE this photograph??  my latest theory: the purple does not accentuate a single thing or even a group of things, it infuses the entire photograph, creating an ethereal effect, and for some reason combines well with gray (a different color and the child would have looked sickly). Then there''s the toughness of the child''s face, combined with the fact that she is presenting us her feet. Instead of the usual vulnerability expected of the photo''s subject, she is well protected, well defended. The flower-in-the-mouth cliche is all about vulnerability. The flower-in-the-feet is all about invulnerability. This shot is a 10.', '2006-10-02 19:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888606, 402269, 50695, '<td valign="top">Now, YOU know how to stage a staged photograph! This is Man Ray quality work. You know just how much of the dark-painted face to show, so that it shimmers between one illusion and another. 10</td>', 'Now, YOU know how to stage a staged photograph! This is Man Ray quality work. You know just how much of the dark-painted face to show, so that it shimmers between one illusion and another. 10', '2006-10-02 19:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888612, 402198, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photo is so wonderfully weird that it insists on getting a 10. You get my purple ribbon. What a face! And the weirdness of her head being yellow amidst the purple grapes. And the old-timey flavor of the high contrast. It all works together for a mind-numbing yet hilarious effect.</td>', 'This photo is so wonderfully weird that it insists on getting a 10. You get my purple ribbon. What a face! And the weirdness of her head being yellow amidst the purple grapes. And the old-timey flavor of the high contrast. It all works together for a mind-numbing yet hilarious effect.', '2006-10-02 19:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888617, 402221, 50695, '<td valign="top">You''ve the three primary colors here in spiraling circles... except the blue phases to purple, the yellow is orangey, the red is pinky... we see here some kind of intriguing intersection between purity and corruption. This would have been great for faceless portrait! Except that on this site, such a stunning picture will score low. Always. Not in spite of its art, but because of it. 9</td>', 'You''ve the three primary colors here in spiraling circles... except the blue phases to purple, the yellow is orangey, the red is pinky... we see here some kind of intriguing intersection between purity and corruption. This would have been great for faceless portrait! Except that on this site, such a stunning picture will score low. Always. Not in spite of its art, but because of it. 9', '2006-10-02 19:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888809, 402259, 64068, '<td valign="top">your DOF too shallow</td>', 'your DOF too shallow', '2006-10-02 20:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888872, 399626, 38032, '<td valign="top">Very striking and interesting macro.</td>', 'Very striking and interesting macro.', '2006-10-02 21:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888881, 400538, 17052, '<td valign="top">Absolutely incredible, beautiful image. LOVE IT!</td>', 'Absolutely incredible, beautiful image. LOVE IT!', '2006-10-02 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888894, 402200, 38032, '<td valign="top">simply adorable shot - oh ... the fabric is great</td>', 'simply adorable shot - oh ... the fabric is great', '2006-10-02 21:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888898, 402075, 38032, '<td valign="top">what a great building ! - nice choice.</td>', 'what a great building ! - nice choice.', '2006-10-02 21:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888901, 401687, 38032, '<td valign="top">great tree, great color and simplicity.  - a really pretty shot.<br/>Only criticism: I sorta wish I could see where the tree hits the ground.</td>', 'great tree, great color and simplicity.  - a really pretty shot.Only criticism: I sorta wish I could see where the tree hits the ground.', '2006-10-02 21:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888933, 400660, 37104, '<td valign="top">My only problem with this is that the focus should be purple, and here it is not. The focus is on the butterfly. Otherwise absolutely teriffic shot!</td>', 'My only problem with this is that the focus should be purple, and here it is not. The focus is on the butterfly. Otherwise absolutely teriffic shot!', '2006-10-02 21:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888937, 401422, 37104, '<td valign="top">Well...the background is purple...</td>', 'Well...the background is purple...', '2006-10-02 21:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888938, 399876, 37104, '<td valign="top">Wow, teriffic! It seems fake. If it is, shame on you, but if not, WOW!</td>', 'Wow, teriffic! It seems fake. If it is, shame on you, but if not, WOW!', '2006-10-02 21:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888943, 402047, 37104, '<td valign="top">Very grainy, but I ove the idea.</td>', 'Very grainy, but I ove the idea.', '2006-10-02 21:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2888969, 401440, 37104, '<td valign="top">Ewwww.....</td>', 'Ewwww.....', '2006-10-02 21:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889077, 398829, 58590, '<td valign="top">I think there needs to be more purple, IMO</td>', 'I think there needs to be more purple, IMO', '2006-10-02 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889085, 401047, 58590, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful!! nice shot too... great portrait</td>', 'She''s beautiful!! nice shot too... great portrait', '2006-10-02 22:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889090, 401508, 58590, '<td valign="top">seems a little blurry or out of focus IMO</td>', 'seems a little blurry or out of focus IMO', '2006-10-02 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889108, 401717, 58590, '<td valign="top">beautifully composed, excellent lighting, and great bokeh effect... very clear... great shot</td>', 'beautifully composed, excellent lighting, and great bokeh effect... very clear... great shot', '2006-10-02 22:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889137, 399346, 58590, '<td valign="top">a bit too blurry IMO</td>', 'a bit too blurry IMO', '2006-10-02 22:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889143, 401751, 58590, '<td valign="top">I think i have the same curtains!!! excellent composition!</td>', 'I think i have the same curtains!!! excellent composition!', '2006-10-02 22:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889168, 401409, 58590, '<td valign="top">a bit blurry... but nice idea</td>', 'a bit blurry... but nice idea', '2006-10-02 22:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889172, 398972, 58590, '<td valign="top">a bit too noisey in spots</td>', 'a bit too noisey in spots', '2006-10-02 22:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
