(2889334, 401707, 65603, '<td valign="top">The orange seemed to over power.</td>', 'The orange seemed to over power.', '2006-10-02 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889432, 402204, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great for the challenge. Very unique. Good luck.</td>', 'Great for the challenge. Very unique. Good luck.', '2006-10-02 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889438, 401823, 35530, '<td valign="top">Great clarity. Very nice.</td>', 'Great clarity. Very nice.', '2006-10-02 23:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889443, 402204, 66456, '<td valign="top">Fun...I''m thinking the Wicked Witch isn''t far behind!</td>', 'Fun...I''m thinking the Wicked Witch isn''t far behind!', '2006-10-02 23:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889478, 402099, 66456, '<td valign="top">Adonized chainrings...</td>', 'Adonized chainrings...', '2006-10-02 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889487, 400746, 66456, '<td valign="top">Nice...original and interesting...</td>', 'Nice...original and interesting...', '2006-10-02 23:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889499, 402256, 35530, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement. Lighting is superb.</td>', 'Nice arrangement. Lighting is superb.', '2006-10-02 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889509, 401997, 13688, '<td valign="top">these are facinating flowers.  i''m surprised they don''t call them leopard lilies, but perhaps there are already some of these leopard colored.  your focus looks real good at the base.  perhaps the other areas of focus are just a limitation of your camera.</td>', 'these are facinating flowers.  i''m surprised they don''t call them leopard lilies, but perhaps there are already some of these leopard colored.  your focus looks real good at the base.  perhaps the other areas of focus are just a limitation of your camera.', '2006-10-03 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889521, 400538, 61818, '<td valign="top">Lighting is so so, pose isn''t that great.  Composition needs a little work.<br/> <br/>No flowers and nice boobs.<br/> <br/>Have a 10.</td>', 'Lighting is so so, pose isn''t that great.  Composition needs a little work. No flowers and nice boobs. Have a 10.', '2006-10-03 00:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889529, 402037, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  i would have cloned out the left rock, to make it even better ;)</td>', 'nice composition.  i would have cloned out the left rock, to make it even better ;)', '2006-10-03 00:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889532, 402099, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice but the bit of lettering there sort of ruins the effect.</td>', 'Nice but the bit of lettering there sort of ruins the effect.', '2006-10-03 00:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889543, 399876, 13688, '<td valign="top">the bird is a nice touch.  wish we had just a bit more room at the top and bottom to not be so constrained.</td>', 'the bird is a nice touch.  wish we had just a bit more room at the top and bottom to not be so constrained.', '2006-10-03 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889626, 402260, 13688, '<td valign="top">really like your tones.  the stem is very distracting and you bring more attention to it with the border...i find that odd.</td>', 'really like your tones.  the stem is very distracting and you bring more attention to it with the border...i find that odd.', '2006-10-03 00:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889629, 401281, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been a really nice shot under softer lighting conditions</td>', 'i think this would have been a really nice shot under softer lighting conditions', '2006-10-03 00:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889637, 401762, 13688, '<td valign="top">obviously a very strong image.  i''m a big fan of funky processing but the smoothing between the eyes is a bit distracting for me. Perhaps that''s what makes everything else stand out so much.</td>', 'obviously a very strong image.  i''m a big fan of funky processing but the smoothing between the eyes is a bit distracting for me. Perhaps that''s what makes everything else stand out so much.', '2006-10-03 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889685, 401939, 41337, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully shot. The DOF is perfect.</td>', 'Wonderfully shot. The DOF is perfect.', '2006-10-03 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889694, 402044, 41337, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Complex yet simple.</td>', 'Excellent. Complex yet simple.', '2006-10-03 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889697, 402260, 41337, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot!', '2006-10-03 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889716, 400469, 41337, '<td valign="top">The wood background does not help, IMO. I''d put this on some colored paper to compliment the ball''s color. <br/> <br/>The lighting on the ball is fine not so on the block. Perhaps try and diffuse the light some more using a curtain or sheet? <br/> <br/>As for the composition, the angle you took creates an uneasy tension. To the viewer it looks like the ball is about to fall off. Perhaps a straight on shot or a lower angle would eliminate that. Also that might help put more focus on the different shapes present, which would boost interest, IMO.</td>', 'The wood background does not help, IMO. I''d put this on some colored paper to compliment the ball''s color.  The lighting on the ball is fine not so on the block. Perhaps try and diffuse the light some more using a curtain or sheet?  As for the composition, the angle you took creates an uneasy tension. To the viewer it looks like the ball is about to fall off. Perhaps a straight on shot or a lower angle would eliminate that. Also that might help put more focus on the different shapes present, which would boost interest, IMO.', '2006-10-03 01:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889724, 401874, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast! For basic editing this came out pretty well. No splash droplets anywhere and the water level is to the rim. Well done.</td>', 'I like the high contrast! For basic editing this came out pretty well. No splash droplets anywhere and the water level is to the rim. Well done.', '2006-10-03 01:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889725, 400755, 55642, '<td valign="top">Wow, I would love to see this larger and uncompressed. It looks like it was munched by Save for Web. But seriously, wow... great shot!</td>', 'Wow, I would love to see this larger and uncompressed. It looks like it was munched by Save for Web. But seriously, wow... great shot!', '2006-10-03 01:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889726, 400883, 41337, '<td valign="top">LOL. I was wondering if someone would use a title like this. Are those warms?</td>', 'LOL. I was wondering if someone would use a title like this. Are those warms?', '2006-10-03 01:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889733, 399460, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.', '2006-10-03 01:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889821, 402229, 49578, '<td valign="top">well, wierd colour of the sky..</td>', 'well, wierd colour of the sky..', '2006-10-03 02:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889832, 402268, 49578, '<td valign="top">what''s that?</td>', 'what''s that?', '2006-10-03 02:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889885, 401412, 49578, '<td valign="top">lovely image! but i see less of purple. Still i give this a 7</td>', 'lovely image! but i see less of purple. Still i give this a 7', '2006-10-03 02:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889929, 399952, 49578, '<td valign="top">nice abstract..</td>', 'nice abstract..', '2006-10-03 03:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889959, 401582, 49578, '<td valign="top">lovely DoF, good composition</td>', 'lovely DoF, good composition', '2006-10-03 03:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889980, 399214, 49578, '<td valign="top">it''s blue!</td>', 'it''s blue!', '2006-10-03 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2889989, 400592, 65756, '<td valign="top">Wow!<br/>I cannot wait until you explain how you got so many droplets over that DVD!</td>', 'Wow!I cannot wait until you explain how you got so many droplets over that DVD!', '2006-10-03 03:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
