(2891147, 402214, 66492, '<td valign="top">cool idea, something about the bottom of the glass doesn''t look as good though, can''t put my finger on what it is. I like the intensity of the liquid though.</td>', 'cool idea, something about the bottom of the glass doesn''t look as good though, can''t put my finger on what it is. I like the intensity of the liquid though.', '2006-10-03 12:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
