(2893786, 402041, 27133, '<td valign="top">Ya wally...come ''ere so I can slap ya....sheshesheseh!!  But as you saw....we are a team.  And when one falls down...the others pick up the slack....we areA TEAM!!<br/> <br/><b>UNTOUCHABLES RULE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</b></td>', 'Ya wally...come ''ere so I can slap ya....sheshesheseh!!  But as you saw....we are a team.  And when one falls down...the others pick up the slack....we areA TEAM!! UNTOUCHABLES RULE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2006-10-04 01:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2893787, 402099, 60320, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone who voted and left comments for me.  I''m quite pleased with my 37th placement out of 283... not too shabby for my very first challenge entry!  Just squeaked in an average above 6 too!<br/> <br/>Kooka was a company that made all kinds of annodized aluminum bike parts.  Back in the day these were really cool accessories to have... But now the company has gone out of business and I scored about 100 chain rings in a rainbow of colors for 50 cents each!  If there are any bicycle dorks out there, you''ll understand how cool that is :)  <br/> <br/>So I know a few people didn''t like the text, or that you can see the entire ring, but I thought it was significant to the subject.  Kooka 24 is a 24 tooth chain ring... count ''em for yourself!<br/> <br/>If I use these chain rings for any other challenges I''ll see what I can do to create a more dynamic image.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone who voted and left comments for me.  I''m quite pleased with my 37th placement out of 283... not too shabby for my very first challenge entry!  Just squeaked in an average above 6 too! Kooka was a company that made all kinds of annodized aluminum bike parts.  Back in the day these were really cool accessories to have... But now the company has gone out of business and I scored about 100 chain rings in a rainbow of colors for 50 cents each!  If there are any bicycle dorks out there, you''ll understand how cool that is :)   So I know a few people didn''t like the text, or that you can see the entire ring, but I thought it was significant to the subject.  Kooka 24 is a 24 tooth chain ring... count ''em for yourself! If I use these chain rings for any other challenges I''ll see what I can do to create a more dynamic image.', '2006-10-04 01:34:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2893798, 401243, 65815, '<td valign="top">I was hoping that everybody accepts subsets of purple, such as indigo, magenta and tyrian purple, as purple. <br/> <br/>Apparently, i was wrong. Oh well, on to the next challenge!</td>', 'I was hoping that everybody accepts subsets of purple, such as indigo, magenta and tyrian purple, as purple.  Apparently, i was wrong. Oh well, on to the next challenge!', '2006-10-04 01:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
