(2893890, 402265, 64446, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments and votes. <br/> <br/>This was a last minute submission (I was working in another pic, on which I gave up and tried to work this out), so I knew it would fall short (though did better than I thought).<br/> <br/>The flower and its background was not very pretty at all, so in order to hide that, I decided just to keep the petals in color and desaturate the rest (camera feature).<br/> <br/>I agree it got oversaturated and it came out more pinky than purple. Also I didn''t like the crop myself.<br/> <br/>Here''s another rendition which I like more (though still too pinky):<br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728'', strrpos(''//www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728"/> <br/><a href="//www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-04 00:51:52.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments and votes.  This was a last minute submission (I was working in another pic, on which I gave up and tried to work this out), so I knew it would fall short (though did better than I thought). The flower and its background was not very pretty at all, so in order to hide that, I decided just to keep the petals in color and desaturate the rest (camera feature). I agree it got oversaturated and it came out more pinky than purple. Also I didn''t like the crop myself. Here''s another rendition which I like more (though still too pinky): //www.pbase.com/gg3rd/image/67681728', '2006-10-04 01:47:53.000000', '2006-10-04 01:51:52.000000', 0),
