(2894105, 399014, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a lousy score for an image that glows so beautifully! Thanks to the lighting, the bloom has taken on an almost sugary look, like what you might find on a wedding cake. I like Sandy''s comment about the natural purple. The frame''s great, the image is subtle and lovely - not too dark at all. Frustrating that you didn''t get more comments.</td>', 'What a lousy score for an image that glows so beautifully! Thanks to the lighting, the bloom has taken on an almost sugary look, like what you might find on a wedding cake. I like Sandy''s comment about the natural purple. The frame''s great, the image is subtle and lovely - not too dark at all. Frustrating that you didn''t get more comments.', '2006-10-04 02:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2894113, 401813, 17507, '<td valign="top">holy christ, I can''t BELIEVE how low this score is. this was definitely one of my favorite images in the challenge; I gave it an 8. the color scheme is strong, the use of purple is not contrived (unlike the top two photos in this challenge, which were clearly edited to include purple), the composition is unusual and refreshing, and the subject matter is unique. really, the ~4.9 score is baffling. what were the voters thinking!??!@?!@?</td>', 'holy christ, I can''t BELIEVE how low this score is. this was definitely one of my favorite images in the challenge; I gave it an 8. the color scheme is strong, the use of purple is not contrived (unlike the top two photos in this challenge, which were clearly edited to include purple), the composition is unusual and refreshing, and the subject matter is unique. really, the ~4.9 score is baffling. what were the voters thinking!??!@?!@?', '2006-10-04 02:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
