(2894147, 401497, 47541, '<td valign="top">On first look I didnt notice that this is a reflection in a mirror so I thought the shoulder in front was a distracting element - if "quick voters" also took this thought that may have cost some points.  Once I looked properly I see it is a nice image but the purple is just not prominent for this challenge.  The composition is good and the lighting adds interest (especially on her hair).  I''m still not sure that the blurred shoulder actually works in this shot.</td>', 'On first look I didnt notice that this is a reflection in a mirror so I thought the shoulder in front was a distracting element - if "quick voters" also took this thought that may have cost some points.  Once I looked properly I see it is a nice image but the purple is just not prominent for this challenge.  The composition is good and the lighting adds interest (especially on her hair).  I''m still not sure that the blurred shoulder actually works in this shot.', '2006-10-04 02:34:58.000000', NULL, 0),
