(2894555, 401234, 65592, '<td valign="top">Thank you everybody for your comments, all them are welcome and will help me to improve.<br/>I think i should give you an explanation about the color,...it''s very simple, i made a mistake in the translation of the word "purple"!!<br/>As you will notice, just check my profile, i am spaniard and when i search for the translation of purple i found two posibilities, "púrpura" and, like C Steve G has pointed out in his comment, "morado". The first one has to do with reds hues and the second one with, well, the color of your eye after being hit by someone fist ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-10-04 05:19:47.</i></td>', 'Thank you everybody for your comments, all them are welcome and will help me to improve.I think i should give you an explanation about the color,...it''s very simple, i made a mistake in the translation of the word "purple"!!As you will notice, just check my profile, i am spaniard and when i search for the translation of purple i found two posibilities, "púrpura" and, like C Steve G has pointed out in his comment, "morado". The first one has to do with reds hues and the second one with, well, the color of your eye after being hit by someone fist ;-)', '2006-10-04 06:19:03.000000', '2006-10-04 06:19:47.000000', 0),
