(2894777, 402037, 36328, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but I have a question. Did you use a filter on the front of the 300D or was it applied after in Photoshop? I only ask because I <b>think</b> (don''t quote me) photographic filters are not allowed in Basic Editing. Like I said, I''m probably wrong as no one else has mentioned it. <br/> <br/>I love the comp. The little boat plays well with the position of the sun. This contrast in the clouds vs sky is nice. I love skys that give the feel of montion. <br/> <br/>Congrats, and I really hope it stick. <br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this shot, but I have a question. Did you use a filter on the front of the 300D or was it applied after in Photoshop? I only ask because I think (don''t quote me) photographic filters are not allowed in Basic Editing. Like I said, I''m probably wrong as no one else has mentioned it.  I love the comp. The little boat plays well with the position of the sun. This contrast in the clouds vs sky is nice. I love skys that give the feel of montion.  Congrats, and I really hope it stick.  ', '2006-10-04 08:25:35.000000', NULL, 0),
