(2895975, 400660, 42792, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pekesty:</b></div><hr/><i> Woohoo...new PB, congratulations!!!  I thought you told me your purple wasn''t doing that well.  Wonderful color and great photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, I was holding my breath till I was blue for sure ''coz the first half of the week, it was as low as 5.7xx.  Never seen my entry score yo-yo so much before over the period of voting. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by pekesty: Woohoo...new PB, congratulations!!!  I thought you told me your purple wasn''t doing that well.  Wonderful color and great photo.   Well, I was holding my breath till I was blue for sure ''coz the first half of the week, it was as low as 5.7xx.  Never seen my entry score yo-yo so much before over the period of voting. :)', '2006-10-04 14:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
