(2898075, 400166, 42013, '<td valign="top">Uh OH, I think i''ve seen enough of your mom and dad to know that we better watch out for the new "too". You followed the composition rules nicely and the angle is a nice touch. True, it might be a little more pink than purple, but I say "fooey on the voters". Cheers!</td>', 'Uh OH, I think i''ve seen enough of your mom and dad to know that we better watch out for the new "too". You followed the composition rules nicely and the angle is a nice touch. True, it might be a little more pink than purple, but I say "fooey on the voters". Cheers!', '2006-10-04 23:33:17.000000', NULL, 0),
