(2900561, 402222, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea and I really like the different shades of purple.  What probably kept it from scoring higher is the noise and shadows.  It appears as if you have a blue light on the left, although it may just appear that way due to PP.  The paint on the top of the picture looks more like a very deep red than purple.  If you want to use existing light, you may need more of it to reduce noise.</td>', 'This is a good idea and I really like the different shades of purple.  What probably kept it from scoring higher is the noise and shadows.  It appears as if you have a blue light on the left, although it may just appear that way due to PP.  The paint on the top of the picture looks more like a very deep red than purple.  If you want to use existing light, you may need more of it to reduce noise.', '2006-10-05 18:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
