(2902160, 402186, 62812, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot but it is just some geezer in a purple shirt in a studio. I gave it a six. The sock is not distracting thats just ridiculous and on the critique list of ''photographers who have to keep to rules'' I think somewhere under rule of thirds. Do your own thing and dont worry about the numbers!<br/>Good luck!<br/></td>', 'It''s a good shot but it is just some geezer in a purple shirt in a studio. I gave it a six. The sock is not distracting thats just ridiculous and on the critique list of ''photographers who have to keep to rules'' I think somewhere under rule of thirds. Do your own thing and dont worry about the numbers!Good luck!', '2006-10-06 06:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
