(2902196, 401045, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hey Deb. I gave this a 5 in the challenge. I felt it met the challenge and was ok but against somepretty heavy duty competition. I think maybe a slightly different layout without the yellow flowers could have helped. Colors are nice and the detail on the center flower is sharp, but overall a big lack of WOW. Black velvet is pretty sweet for backgrounds though isnt it?</td>', 'Hey Deb. I gave this a 5 in the challenge. I felt it met the challenge and was ok but against somepretty heavy duty competition. I think maybe a slightly different layout without the yellow flowers could have helped. Colors are nice and the detail on the center flower is sharp, but overall a big lack of WOW. Black velvet is pretty sweet for backgrounds though isnt it?', '2006-10-06 07:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902206, 400810, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I think the biggest problem is the noise on this. Takes away from the softness of the shot. ISO at 1600 will do that to you.</td>', 'Nice picture. I think the biggest problem is the noise on this. Takes away from the softness of the shot. ISO at 1600 will do that to you.', '2006-10-06 07:46:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902211, 400993, 53147, '<td valign="top">I gav ethis a 5. Fooey on the "it''s pink not purple" people - if they read te title they would have seen that your focus was the berry. And even if it wasnt, I would consider the restof the plant to be a shade of purple - definitley not worthy of a DNMC vote. The layout seems a bit busy and cluttered. A differetn angle may have freed up some negative space between the stems. The sharpness seems a bit off as well. And to gaurantee a black background whenever you shoot just carry around a $30 piece of black velvet - works every time.</td>', 'I gav ethis a 5. Fooey on the "it''s pink not purple" people - if they read te title they would have seen that your focus was the berry. And even if it wasnt, I would consider the restof the plant to be a shade of purple - definitley not worthy of a DNMC vote. The layout seems a bit busy and cluttered. A differetn angle may have freed up some negative space between the stems. The sharpness seems a bit off as well. And to gaurantee a black background whenever you shoot just carry around a $30 piece of black velvet - works every time.', '2006-10-06 07:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902382, 401685, 35602, '<td valign="top">I like the orange contrast on this one.  It made an interesting reflection in the plastic beads.  The overall effect is lacking in contrast, though.  The orange gave it some zip, but not enough.</td>', 'I like the orange contrast on this one.  It made an interesting reflection in the plastic beads.  The overall effect is lacking in contrast, though.  The orange gave it some zip, but not enough.', '2006-10-06 09:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902441, 400993, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - you and I both seemed to like the diagonal/part out of focus thing for this challenge.  Not sure what''s up with the voters these days - I really do think they''re getting harsher all the time.  This has a nice abstract feel to it - good lines.</td>', 'Heh - you and I both seemed to like the diagonal/part out of focus thing for this challenge.  Not sure what''s up with the voters these days - I really do think they''re getting harsher all the time.  This has a nice abstract feel to it - good lines.', '2006-10-06 10:14:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902447, 402186, 15711, '<td valign="top">GOD - I would think he was Joey Lawrence''s clone!!!!  Didn''t vote on this one, but I like it. Nice lighting and use of neg. space.</td>', 'GOD - I would think he was Joey Lawrence''s clone!!!!  Didn''t vote on this one, but I like it. Nice lighting and use of neg. space.', '2006-10-06 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902449, 400166, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a giant tongue sticking out!  Very cool!  I like the angle, too.  Nice job, Aidan!</td>', 'Looks like a giant tongue sticking out!  Very cool!  I like the angle, too.  Nice job, Aidan!', '2006-10-06 10:17:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902526, 399876, 63244, '<td valign="top">I leave town for one week and come back to this.  WOW!!  Congrats on yet another ribbon and an amazing shot!  Great job!</td>', 'I leave town for one week and come back to this.  WOW!!  Congrats on yet another ribbon and an amazing shot!  Great job!', '2006-10-06 10:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2902886, 401762, 63244, '<td valign="top">Hannes, this is absolutely amazing!  What a fabulous portrait and very, very well done!  Color and composition are top notch!  Kuddos to you for taking this and congrats on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Hannes, this is absolutely amazing!  What a fabulous portrait and very, very well done!  Color and composition are top notch!  Kuddos to you for taking this and congrats on your first ribbon!', '2006-10-06 12:27:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903186, 400766, 55838, '<td valign="top">IMO this shot could be improved by cropping out much of the stem (although it is a cool looking stem) and perhaps the flower could be turned only slightly more toward the camera.  The bokeh is attractive but a little bit busy - if the sharp purple flower covered a bit more of the surface area in the pic, perhaps the background would be less distracting.  My vote was 5.</td>', 'IMO this shot could be improved by cropping out much of the stem (although it is a cool looking stem) and perhaps the flower could be turned only slightly more toward the camera.  The bokeh is attractive but a little bit busy - if the sharp purple flower covered a bit more of the surface area in the pic, perhaps the background would be less distracting.  My vote was 5.', '2006-10-06 13:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903250, 401760, 64610, '<td valign="top">I think this is such a creative photo.  I love it.</td>', 'I think this is such a creative photo.  I love it.', '2006-10-06 14:25:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903268, 399876, 22517, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, well done and congratulations!</td>', 'Beautiful picture, well done and congratulations!', '2006-10-06 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903272, 401281, 9285, '<td valign="top">This is a tough challenge ... . . .. . . . To me.. <br/>:)<br/> <br/>I''m never good with flowers..  <br/>If I were to tackle the theme.. I would go for a really really close crop... Bring out the purple.. and keep the other colours out of the picture.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=406996" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9285/thumb/406996.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9285/thumb/406996.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9285/thumb/406996.jpg"/></a> &gt; this''s what I meant.. <br/> <br/>Have fun..</td>', 'This is a tough challenge ... . . .. . . . To me.. :) I''m never good with flowers..  If I were to tackle the theme.. I would go for a really really close crop... Bring out the purple.. and keep the other colours out of the picture. > this''s what I meant..  Have fun..', '2006-10-06 14:40:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903522, 400746, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6 which is my vote for a solid shot.  The shot is abstract in nature, which allows it to not have a focal point.  The curved geometry is nice.<br/> <br/>I think the biggest downside for me was that the purple seemed to be the result of a shift.  This is not to say that a shift is bad (clearly I shifted the WB on my own shot), BUT I think the purple looks a bit muddled when you don''t have true blacks and whites in the shot.  The blacks look real (although I didn''t pull it into PS), but you can see the whites have a cast to them.  I didn''t quite like that, and that''s probably what kept it from getting a 7 or 8.</td>', 'I gave this a 6 which is my vote for a solid shot.  The shot is abstract in nature, which allows it to not have a focal point.  The curved geometry is nice. I think the biggest downside for me was that the purple seemed to be the result of a shift.  This is not to say that a shift is bad (clearly I shifted the WB on my own shot), BUT I think the purple looks a bit muddled when you don''t have true blacks and whites in the shot.  The blacks look real (although I didn''t pull it into PS), but you can see the whites have a cast to them.  I didn''t quite like that, and that''s probably what kept it from getting a 7 or 8.', '2006-10-06 15:57:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903761, 400836, 12253, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot--I knew it would do well.  It has a real inkblot feel to it in thumbnail, as well as great details when you look at it enlarged.  Congrats on #11.</td>', 'This is a great shot--I knew it would do well.  It has a real inkblot feel to it in thumbnail, as well as great details when you look at it enlarged.  Congrats on #11.', '2006-10-06 17:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903793, 399790, 40718, '<td valign="top">The technicals:  I think a big part of your issue is actually the halogen lamp.  They give off such a shifted color that sometimes it''s hard to work with, especially when you are going for purple (cool) rather than yellow (warm).  What happens in PP is you get pixelation and saturation problems in the highlights like you see here.  There are also noise issues, which seem to be a no-no on DPC.<br/> <br/>The feel: nicely abstract.  I may have included more of the paper towel and less negative space along the bottom.<br/> <br/>The game: abstracts always have a tough time outside abstract challenges here on DPC.</td>', 'The technicals:  I think a big part of your issue is actually the halogen lamp.  They give off such a shifted color that sometimes it''s hard to work with, especially when you are going for purple (cool) rather than yellow (warm).  What happens in PP is you get pixelation and saturation problems in the highlights like you see here.  There are also noise issues, which seem to be a no-no on DPC. The feel: nicely abstract.  I may have included more of the paper towel and less negative space along the bottom. The game: abstracts always have a tough time outside abstract challenges here on DPC.', '2006-10-06 17:49:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903884, 401874, 57320, '<td valign="top">Hey Magnus,<br/>Loved it and gave it a ten, no suprise that it''s you work!</td>', 'Hey Magnus,Loved it and gave it a ten, no suprise that it''s you work!', '2006-10-06 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2903958, 399876, 56109, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2006-10-06 19:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2904015, 401762, 42125, '<td valign="top">Now this is amazing.<br/>Who in the world gives this a "1" or "2"?<br/>The results are so close! If there were only 2x"1" and 2x"2" like the second place had, this would have got 6,8723 and would therefore have taken the 2nd place.<br/>Sadly the Trolls took their toll now.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your ribbon on this great picture.</td>', 'Now this is amazing.Who in the world gives this a "1" or "2"?The results are so close! If there were only 2x"1" and 2x"2" like the second place had, this would have got 6,8723 and would therefore have taken the 2nd place.Sadly the Trolls took their toll now. Congratulations on your ribbon on this great picture.', '2006-10-06 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
