(2942930, 402130, 43437, '<td valign="top">uber cool!  Pretty sure that isnt a real word but thats the first thing that came to mind.  I love the way the lights wind through the picture, gives it a very interesting look.</td>', 'uber cool!  Pretty sure that isnt a real word but thats the first thing that came to mind.  I love the way the lights wind through the picture, gives it a very interesting look.', '2006-10-19 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
