(3275176, 401293, 58665, '<td valign="top">Fabulous pic Ev, maybe not the right challenge choice? As it requires people to think out of the box ;-)  <br/> <br/>I definitely think this is one of your best!!!!  You have nailed the rule of thirds in this one, and the leading line of the arms to the baby are superb. Oh great use of negative space as well.<br/> <br/>Sam</td>', 'Fabulous pic Ev, maybe not the right challenge choice? As it requires people to think out of the box ;-)   I definitely think this is one of your best!!!!  You have nailed the rule of thirds in this one, and the leading line of the arms to the baby are superb. Oh great use of negative space as well. Sam', '2007-01-24 11:01:38.000000', NULL, 0),
