(3317159, 401275, 69008, '<td valign="top">This is one of my fav types of flowers, the iris. This is an image that would have done very well in the recent "Shallow DOF" challenge.  These are difficult to photograph well, and you have it just right with this image.</td>', 'This is one of my fav types of flowers, the iris. This is an image that would have done very well in the recent "Shallow DOF" challenge.  These are difficult to photograph well, and you have it just right with this image.', '2007-02-02 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3407738, 401762, 19982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes.  Adding to my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes.  Adding to my favorites.', '2007-02-26 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3473638, 401634, 5792, '<td valign="top">Positives:<br/>Generally good composition and an OK, if not spectacular, still life image.<br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>Use of the rule of thirds is very good but, in general, the images falls down in technicals. There is lack of detail in the purple flowers, it has a number of overexposed areas on the ribbons and the BG color changes and tonal shifts are weak. A good still life image requires perfect technicals. Strong tones are a must. You want tones to be very smooth and yours are not. For still life images you want to strive to have unique light that highlights some special aspect of the subject.<br/> <br/>The challenge:<br/>This image meets the challenge but generally does not offer the viewer much more reason to look at it. Still life images typically do not do well at DPC and your score reflects that both for content and technical reasons.<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/>Contrary to popular belief, still life images are very difficult because they require perfect technicals to have impact. They are studies in lighting and shadows and you must pay particular attention to lighting and tones issues to get a good result.<br/> <br/>I would try another still life keeping in mind lighting and shadows to set it apart from the ordinary, then strive to post process the best it can possibly be to highlight those things.<br/> <br/>Some cameras are better suited to some types of imagery over others. Your Coolpix 950 is pretty old technology and that makes still life images more difficult for you.</td>', 'Positives:Generally good composition and an OK, if not spectacular, still life image. Technicals:Use of the rule of thirds is very good but, in general, the images falls down in technicals. There is lack of detail in the purple flowers, it has a number of overexposed areas on the ribbons and the BG color changes and tonal shifts are weak. A good still life image requires perfect technicals. Strong tones are a must. You want tones to be very smooth and yours are not. For still life images you want to strive to have unique light that highlights some special aspect of the subject. The challenge:This image meets the challenge but generally does not offer the viewer much more reason to look at it. Still life images typically do not do well at DPC and your score reflects that both for content and technical reasons. Suggestions:Contrary to popular belief, still life images are very difficult because they require perfect technicals to have impact. They are studies in lighting and shadows and you must pay particular attention to lighting and tones issues to get a good result. I would try another still life keeping in mind lighting and shadows to set it apart from the ordinary, then strive to post process the best it can possibly be to highlight those things. Some cameras are better suited to some types of imagery over others. Your Coolpix 950 is pretty old technology and that makes still life images more difficult for you.', '2007-03-19 18:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3498614, 401874, 72317, '<td valign="top">I think the spots on the glass give it a certain.. Idk.. It makes it look better. Makes it look like a real photograph without making it look like crap. Looks like you hit the button at precisely the right moment. The swirls are flawless but so natural. I just love it.</td>', 'I think the spots on the glass give it a certain.. Idk.. It makes it look better. Makes it look like a real photograph without making it look like crap. Looks like you hit the button at precisely the right moment. The swirls are flawless but so natural. I just love it.', '2007-03-30 00:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3498620, 401733, 72317, '<td valign="top">I am amazed. I couldn''t have pulled this off if my life depended on it. Fantastic.</td>', 'I am amazed. I couldn''t have pulled this off if my life depended on it. Fantastic.', '2007-03-30 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(3498644, 401733, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very, very clever, and I like this concept.....</td>', 'Very, very clever, and I like this concept.....', '2007-03-30 00:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3508383, 401497, 69008, '<td valign="top">I see the purple pattern and dress as bringing back fond memories for her when associated with her expression. It took me a few seconds to see that the primary image is a reflection, so that likely caused trouble with the voting. I think that it adds a full dimension to the image to have the bare shoulder the way it is.  The image meets the challenge just fine to me. The purple pattern is the focal point of the emotion connected with the image.  The backlit highlight in the hair is a plus too.</td>', 'I see the purple pattern and dress as bringing back fond memories for her when associated with her expression. It took me a few seconds to see that the primary image is a reflection, so that likely caused trouble with the voting. I think that it adds a full dimension to the image to have the bare shoulder the way it is.  The image meets the challenge just fine to me. The purple pattern is the focal point of the emotion connected with the image.  The backlit highlight in the hair is a plus too.', '2007-04-02 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3625402, 402122, 77968, '<td valign="top">A beautifully contrasted piece, nice clarity, wonderfully composed and presented. -john</td>', 'A beautifully contrasted piece, nice clarity, wonderfully composed and presented. -john', '2007-05-07 17:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
